<title>HUNGARY: Budapest BSE reports record share turnover in June.</title>
<headline>Budapest BSE reports record share turnover in June.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monthly share turnover and total monthly turnover in June hit record highs on the Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE)'s spot market, figures in the BSE's monthly report shgwed.</p>
<p>Share turnover rose to 202.43 billion forints in June from 159.25 billion forints in May, while total turnover rallied to 541.61 billion forints from 397.26 billion forints in the previous month, it added.</p>
<p>TOTAL BSE TURNOVER - in billion forints, including double counting of sales and purchases)</p>
